# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Data & databases
# Datasets are usually too large for git and often aren't yours
# to redistribute. Keep a download script instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.duckdb

# Uncomment these if you'd rather not version raw data at all:
# *.csv
# *.tsv
# *.parquet
# *.feather
# data/raw/
# data/interim/

